{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜個握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋にかき氷機があって、\nカルピスかき氷食べた！うまうま！\nみなさんのすきなかき氷シロップは\nなんですか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はねー\n贅沢言っちゃうと\n抹茶小豆とか\n苺がのったいちごミルクかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわのかき氷食べてえええええ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今日の私服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 三つ編み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミリタリーシャツ Heather\nスカート PANAMABOY\nネイビーのリボンお気に入り♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 なんちゃってボブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔色のヘアバンドかわゆし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部 ゆる巻き\nマキシワンピ着たけど\n写真撮り忘れてしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会、列までできてて、、\n2部3部始まる前びっくりしてました。\nわーいわーい\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブブカ読んでくれた方\nいっぱい来てくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ読んでいない方はぜひ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集気になるよね〜\nまだ秘密だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も暑かったね。\n暑い中来てくれて握手してくれて\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のとき\n夏バテしないようにね\nって言ってた私ですが、\n握手終わった後いつの間にか\n楽屋でぐっすり寝てましたーわー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局5部終わるまで帰らなかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こまめに水分補給するの大事だ。\n熱中症等に気をつけてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことばが足りてなかったり\nするかもしれない、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくれてありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/11/3300267/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}